erSource, the leading provider of hospitality technology moved their on-premises analytics environment to MicroStrategy Cloud Platform on AWS to streamline costs, reduce data discrepancies, and address security and scalability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/microstrategy-inc-mstr-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"MSTR 2019 Q4","e":"mstr","d":"2020-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"Second, since I've taken over the sales teams, we've revisited territories and reduced headcount by focusing on sales productivity and lowering overhead costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/28/microstrategy-inc-mstr-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q1","e":"mstr","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"This combination of strong customer interest, greater flexibility and significant cost savings encourage us to focus more on virtual marketing resources and events going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/microstrategy-inc-mstr-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q1","e":"mstr","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"With regard to expenses, as we discussed last quarter, we believe we have to rightsize the organization to allow us to continue to invest in the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/microstrategy-inc-mstr-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q2","e":"mstr","d":"2020-07-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"And so, shifting into a Zooming environment with streaming video in order to do sales, marketing, and services, it is just one of the profoundly interesting dividends of the year 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/microstrategy-mstr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q2","e":"mstr","d":"2020-07-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"They can go to our website, they can learn everything you need to know about the product offering from streaming videos.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/microstrategy-mstr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q2","e":"mstr","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"We recently reduced our workforce by 6% in early July.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/microstrategy-mstr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q2","e":"mstr","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"We're simplifying and streamlining our go-to-market approach, including our offerings and pricing, and we'll be offering a Cloud-first platform as a service solution with a greater focus on prospects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/microstrategy-mstr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q3","e":"mstr","d":"2020-10-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"It's the explosion of on-demand streaming video.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/microstrategy-mstr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q3","e":"mstr","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"Our engineers and technology have thought long and hard about how we streamline, accelerate and virtualize our product offering, and I'm just incredibly excited about where we're headed with that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/microstrategy-mstr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q4","e":"mstr","d":"2021-01-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"Of course, we'll generate huge amounts of content that will be uploaded as on-demand streaming content so that it continues to work for our customers in the coming 12 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/microstrategy-mstr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2020 Q4","e":"mstr","d":"2021-01-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"Certainly, 2 million hours or more of -- probably 2 million to 4 million hours of streaming video on YouTube that we've contributed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/microstrategy-mstr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2021 Q1","e":"mstr","d":"2021-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"In essence, the website has become a streaming on-demand version of the company's sales force marketing function and even its executive team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/microstrategy-mstr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2021 Q1","e":"mstr","d":"2021-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"We did a keynote for MicroStrategy World with myself and Ross Stevens that ended up streaming 500,000 sessions, just that one keynote and to reach 500,000 people with a session, of course, is a game-changer for us compared to the way we used to communicate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/microstrategy-mstr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2021 Q1","e":"mstr","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Saylor","x":"We have moved to streamline and to improve the productivity of our technical offering by emphasizing the cloud, by emphasizing ease of use, by emphasizing speed and performance and simplicity with our Hyper Now offering, our cloud offering, and are soon to be Intel Now offering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/microstrategy-mstr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2021 Q3","e":"mstr","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"During this year, enterprises have prioritized the use of a unified platform that can deliver a broad set of use cases and are typically seeing significant cost savings through vendor consolidation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/30/microstrategy-mstr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2022 Q2","e":"mstr","d":"2022-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Kang","x":"While our Bitcoin holdings are impaired when the price drops below the carrying value under current accounting rules, conversely, when the price increases, accounting rules do not allow the carrying value to be revised upward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/microstrategy-mstr-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2022 Q2","e":"mstr","d":"2022-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"As seen in the current markets, many software and crypto exposed companies have had to adjust a periods of rapid cost and headcount growth by rightsizing their teens or freezing hiring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/microstrategy-mstr-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2022 Q3","e":"mstr","d":"2022-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"Our competition prefers dashboard proliferation, departmental visualizations, single stack vendor lock-in and price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/01/microstrategy-mstr-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2022 Q3","e":"mstr","d":"2022-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phong Le","x":"Those include business agility, enterprise security, regular updates and upgrades and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/01/microstrategy-mstr-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSTR 2022 Q3","e":"mstr","d":"2022-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Kang","x":"I feel like we're seeing competition for talent slow a with general recession fears and cost cutting in the overall technol